expert tiers: warm experts round-robin across layers instead of filling layer by layer -- decode touches every layer on each step, so the old order left layers 7..39 cold while burning the first 60s, and every MoE layer fell back to a disk read (measured on L20: 76 experts/s, 173s to fill 13150 entries, GPU 0-16 percent util with the CPU at 189 percent on the read path)